    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 31,
    "summary": "Moses sends forth 12,000 warriors who destroy the Midianites—The prey is divided in Israel—None in the armies of Israel are lost.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And the Lord spake unto Moses, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
